  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Baron’s Imposing Mausoleum</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Infiltration sphere (any [approach] talent)</p>\n<p>While you are in an Infiltration Sphere approach, whenever the GM rolls on a Random Treasure Table to determine what treasure you find or rolls dice to determine how much of specific items you find from treasure or a creature, they roll twice and tell you both results (rolling for the number of items each time). You may then choose which of the two rolled items you wish to find.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/infiltration#toc39\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
